  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>Six years on the terraces downwind of the station, recording the wind-fed cultivation cycle and the households that work it. It is the fullest account of settlement anywhere in the dwarf galaxy and the only one with life histories in it, all of them pseudonymised and held under restriction. The team overlapped with its relief by a fortnight, as the cycle requires, and handed over a station in good order and a filing system that nobody has understood since.</p>",
